                <tr>
                  <td>
                     </p> 
                    
                    <p>
                      <span style="font-weight: 400;">Traditional specialty meat supply chain has no traceability in case of contamination or outbreak </span> </td>
                    </p>
                    
                    <td>
                      <span style="font-weight: 400;">Blockchain-based distributed ledger will keep track of the meat from the farm to the store to ensure easy accountability and traceability </span>
                    </td>
                    
                    <p>
