                    <p>
                      <br />  
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>
                      <span style="font-weight: 400;">Buying meat from one’s local butcher may seem like a mundane chore but for a specialty consumer, it can mean looking forward to long lines and a chaotic in-store environment. Most of these stores are family-owned businesses that have been passed down through generations and do not possess the resources to go digital. </span>
                    </p>
                    
                    <p>
                      <span style="font-weight: 400;">GoMeat’s whitepaper was written all the way back in 2017 and the goal was always blockchain centric but the company wanted to prove their business case first. After 3 years of learning in the market, GoMeat finally launched its pre-ICO on 24</span><span style="font-weight: 400;">th</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> of June which sold out 2 weeks early and reached the soft-cap target within a month. </span>
                    </p>
                    
